    "problem_statement": "CoAP message handling needs a new, explicit interface for constructing and parsing messages. A CoAP message should be initializable with a type, code and message id; its header should be parseable into a structure exposing type, code, message id and token; options should be iterable so the payload marker can be detected and the offset to the payload obtained; a payload marker should be appendable without duplication; and header parsing should support a mode that either rejects a message carrying a payload marker with no following payload, or removes such a marker. Reading and writing the type, code and message id, and updating the type and message id in place, should reflect the changes back in the message.",
